    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Heritage Signature (RFI v1.0).</strong></p><p><em>&ldquo;The mountain ate a war once, and remembered.&rdquo;</em></p><p><strong>Magma Memory.</strong> Magma Memory is the banked heat of the land&rsquo;s last temper moving through you. 1/Soma Break, as an action: speak a single true sentence about an event this stone-body (or the formation it came from) witnessed before it was ambulatory. The GM answers with one image, scent, or taste the land retained. If the truth is still relevant to a current scene, gain <strong>1 Surge</strong>.</p>",
